00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.400
Hi, Anastasiia here. I thought it would be easier
to say hi in a video than in a post.

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:07.400
So here I am.

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:13.400
What I like best about being a designer
isn't the polish or the big picture —

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:17.400
it's the moment when everything falls into place.

00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:22.400
The button is right, the text is right,
and you know it works.

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:29.400
I work pretty fast at the start of a project,
and slow down toward the end.

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:35.800
I use AI tools and prompts in my work every day.

00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:41.800
Not because they're trendy, but because they give me
more time for the parts I like best —

00:00:41.800 --> 00:00:44.800
sitting with the problem and finding the right way.

00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:52.800
I've lived in Oslo for four years, originally from Ukraine,
and there's a lot I'm proud of along the way.
